# Data, State, and Auth Rules

## Roles

Current roles:
- normal_user
- company
- delivery_agent
- admin

Do not invent new roles without updating:
- Prisma schema
- shared constants/types
- backend guards
- mobile routing
- admin UI

## Cart

Cart behavior must support:
- guest cart
- server cart
- cart badge
- guest cart merge on login
- checkout from authenticated cart

Do not break guest cart behavior.

## Company pricing

Company pricing is allowed only when:
- user role is company
- company profile exists
- company status is approved

Frontend may show/hide UI, but backend must enforce pricing.

## Delivery

Delivery status changes must:
- update order status
- update delivery status/history
- invalidate related mobile queries
- not allow unassigned drivers to update orders

## Query invalidation

After mutations, invalidate affected queries:
- cart
- cart count
- orders
- order detail
- delivery orders
- delivery order detail
- wishlist
- addresses